{"id": "t03-9268f8", "status": "read", "groups": [{"levels": [[{"surface": "أبو بكر بن أبي شيبة", "kind": "narrator"}], [{"surface": "غندر", "kind": "narrator"}], [{"surface": "شعبة", "kind": "narrator"}]]}, {"levels": [[{"surface": "محمد بن المثنى", "kind": "narrator"}, {"surface": "ابن بشار", "kind": "narrator"}], [{"surface": "محمد بن جعفر", "kind": "narrator"}], [{"surface": "شعبة", "kind": "narrator"}]]}], "shared_tail": [[{"surface": "الحكم", "kind": "narrator"}], [{"surface": "مجاهد", "kind": "narrator"}], [{"surface": "ابن عباس", "kind": "narrator"}]], "needs_ruling": false, "notes": ["«ح» joins two branches; each names Shu'ba itself, and the names after him (Hakam, Mujahid, Ibn Abbas) are written once after the last «ح», so they are the shared tail", "the Prophet's saying ends at Ibn Abbas; «عن النبي» is the end, not a link"], "fixes": []}